<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Water Resupply for Street Food Vendors</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    body {
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #c3e4fd 0%, #a2d4ab 100%);
      font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #232323;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 32px auto 0 auto;
      padding: 0 18px 48px 18px;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }

    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-top: 42px;
      font-size: 2.1em;
      color: #2369b2;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    p {
      text-align: center;
      color: #53737d;
      font-size: 1.12em;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .product-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .product-card {
      background: #f6faff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 8px 0 rgba(35, 105, 178, 0.07);
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      transition: transform 0.17s;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      height: 100%;
    }

    .product-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.03);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px 0 rgba(35, 105, 178, 0.12);
    }

    .product-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: 160px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #dde9f7;
    }

    .product-info {
      padding: 18px 16px 14px 16px;
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 100%;
    }

    .product-info h2 {
      font-size: 1.17em;
      color: #1661a9;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }

    .product-info p {
      font-size: 1em;
      color: #53737d;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .price {
      background: #dff3df;
      color: #297c33;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.05em;
      align-self: flex-start;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 7px 0 rgba(41, 124, 51, 0.08);
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .order-form {
      background: #f1f7fc;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 24px 24px 10px 24px;
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px auto;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px 0 rgba(35, 105, 178, 0.06);
    }

    .order-form h2 {
      text-align: center;
      color: #2167a1;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-size: 1.25em;
    }

    form label {
      display: block;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #3877b2;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    form select,
    form input[type="number"] {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #d7dded;
      border-radius: 7px;
      background: #fff;
      color: #194267;
      font-size: 1em;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      outline: none;
    }

    button[type="submit"] {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px 0;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #3bb78f 20%, #1661a9 80%);
      color: #fff;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 7px;
      font-size: 1.1em;
      margin-top: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 8px 0 rgba(51, 186, 143, 0.09);
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    button[type="submit"]:hover {
      opacity: 0.92;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #1661a9 40%, #3bb78f 80%);
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: #4971b8;
      font-size: 0.98em;
      padding: 22px 0 16px 0;
      background: rgba(243, 250, 255, 0.85);
      border-top: 1px solid #e0eef7;
      border-radius: 0 0 24px 24px;
      margin-top: -24px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .container {
        padding: 0 6px;
      }

      .product-grid {
        gap: 17px;
      }

      .order-form {
        padding: 18px 6px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 1.6em;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>
      <span style="color:#359045;">&#128167;</span> Water Resupply for Street Food Vendors
    </h1>
    <p>
      Running low on water? <br>
      <b>Order your essential supplies quickly</b> and keep your stall running smoothly!
    </p>
    <div class="product-grid">
      <div class="product-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549247738-4e390c2a5135?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=200"
          alt="20 Liter Water Bottle" class="product-image" />
        <div class="product-info">
          <h2>20 Liter Water Bottle</h2>
          <p>Standard size for daily operations. High-quality purified drinking water for all your needs.</p>
          <div class="price">&#8377;20.00</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596765796030-ff6f991f8931?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=200"
          alt="200 Liter Water Drum" class="product-image" />
        <div class="product-info">
          <h2>200 Liter Water Drum</h2>
          <p>Bulk supply for busy vendors/multiple stalls. Ideal for extensive cooking and cleaning tasks.</p>
          <div class="price">&#8377;650.00</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1627092120017-d2b516147496?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=200"
          alt="5 Liter bottles (pack of 6)" class="product-image" />
        <div class="product-info">
          <h2>5 Liter (Pack of 6)</h2>
          <p>Smaller bottles for easy handling/quick refills, perfect for drinking water.</p>
          <div class="price">&#8377;420.00</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600869353916-b186b51c8810?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=200"
          alt="Water Purification Tablets" class="product-image" />
        <div class="product-info">
          <h2>Water Purification Tablets</h2>
          <p>Emergency purification for any water source. Pack of 100 for safety and contingency planning.</p>
          <div class="price">&#8377;120.00</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="order-form">
      <h2>Place Your Order</h2>
      <form id="orderForm" action="#" method="POST">
        <label for="water-type">Select Water Product:</label>
        <select id="water-type" name="water_type" required>
          <option value="">-- Please Select --</option>
          <option value="20L">20 Liter Water Bottle</option>
          <option value="200L">200 Liter Water Drum</option>
          <option value="5L_pack">5 Liter (Pack of 6)</option>
          <option value="purification_tabs">Water Purification Tablets</option>
        </select>
        <label for="quantity">Quantity:</label>
        <input type="number" id="quantity" name="quantity" min="1" value="1" required />
        <button type="submit">&#128722; Place Order</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 Street Food Supplies. All rights reserved.</p>
    <p>For urgent deliveries, call: <b>+91 98765 43210</b></p>
  </footer>
</body>

</html>
